{"unit_id":"7eef22f91736b95037a0","title":"7.5%者即可開立。","kind":"advisory","blocks":[{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b9","raw_text":"7.5%者即可開立。 \n","start_char":104,"end_char":116,"bbox":[42.543701171875,380.9056701660156,552.8500366210938,431.42156982421875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":" ݟ\n","start_char":0,"end_char":3,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"ݠ\n","start_char":3,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"ݡ\n","start_char":5,"end_char":7,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"ݢ有關HCV reflex testing 申報方式及HCV RNA 定量檢驗管控：HCV RNA 檢驗需於\n","start_char":7,"end_char":62,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"Anti-HCV 陽性後方能檢測，且需事先於VPN 查詢有無重複檢驗，並將檢驗結果上傳\n","start_char":62,"end_char":106,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"雲端。此外建議健保署做重複檢驗API 提醒和請南區業務組做相關檔案分析，討論\n","start_char":106,"end_char":145,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b10","raw_text":"管控方式，避免重複及不必要之檢驗。 \n","start_char":145,"end_char":164,"bbox":[42.57171630859375,444.0154724121094,550.1836547851562,515.057861328125]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":" ݟ\n","start_char":0,"end_char":3,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"ݠ\n","start_char":3,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"ݡ\n","start_char":5,"end_char":7,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"ݢ追認增列DM 用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist：限已接受最大耐受劑量\n","start_char":7,"end_char":56,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"Metformin 及/或Sulfonylurea 類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6 個月後，HbA1C\n","start_char":56,"end_char":109,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"仍高於8.0% 之type2DM 患者：① SGLT2i，② DPP4i，③ SGLT2i/DPP4i 複方製劑，\n","start_char":109,"end_char":167,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b11","raw_text":"④ Insulin(每日劑量小於60 單位）。另外本藥品不得與DPP4i、SGLT2i 併用。 \n","start_char":167,"end_char":216,"bbox":[42.571807861328125,527.6517333984375,556.2966918945312,598.7098388671875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":" ݟ\n","start_char":0,"end_char":3,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":"ݠ\n","start_char":3,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":"ݡ\n","start_char":5,"end_char":7,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":"ݢ有關南區業務組以電腦程式檢核欣流用藥，造成正常開藥而不符年齡使用者行政核\n","start_char":7,"end_char":45,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":"刪，已請健保署進行程式修正，並請院所對核刪有疑義時，主動聯繫承辦人員協助\n","start_char":45,"end_char":82,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b12","raw_text":"處理。 \n","start_char":82,"end_char":87,"bbox":[42.57183837890625,611.3037109375,552.8120727539062,664.108154296875]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b13","raw_text":" ݟ\n","start_char":0,"end_char":3,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,676.7020263671875,552.81201171875,711.2684936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b13","raw_text":"ݠ\n","start_char":3,"end_char":5,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,676.7020263671875,552.81201171875,711.2684936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b13","raw_text":"ݡ\n","start_char":5,"end_char":7,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,676.7020263671875,552.81201171875,711.2684936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b13","raw_text":"ݢ討論有關醫療資源不足地區改善方案和巡迴點未有基層診所申請辦理巡迴計畫，將\n","start_char":7,"end_char":45,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,676.7020263671875,552.81201171875,711.2684936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b13","raw_text":"提共管會和總額研商會議進一步討論。 \n","start_char":45,"end_char":64,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,676.7020263671875,552.81201171875,711.2684936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b14","raw_text":"南委會感謝各位委員、組員的參與，以及會員醫師的支持，期待共同珍惜健保\n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,724.4661254882812,546.4449462890625,757.9049682617188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b14","raw_text":"資源，為維護點值而努力。貳、決議事項 \n","start_char":35,"end_char":55,"bbox":[42.571834564208984,724.4661254882812,546.4449462890625,757.9049682617188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-1a7882ce610ea67aee35-p2-b15","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[42.599998474121094,774.5183715820312,46.1099967956543,793.4302978515625]}],"source_quality":["第 2 頁文字品質待核對"]}